    "offering_evidence_count": 12,
    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we add new carriers, our existing agents have a broader and more competitive suite of products to sell.",
        "start_character": 17423,
        "end_character": 17529
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By integrating multiple carriers on our unified platform, we are also able to offer a wider array of products tailored to various consumer profiles, creating a significant competitive advantage that compounds over time and helps us achieve our mission of democratizing access to life insurance.",
        "start_character": 8702,
        "end_character": 8996
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we compete with various other companies that provide risk-related services or alternatives to traditional insurance services, including other competing start-up companies, which are focused on using technology and innovation, including AI, machine learning, digital platforms, data analytics, robotics, and blockchain, to simplify and improve the customer experience, increase efficiencies, alter business models and effect other potentially disruptive changes in the industries in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 36127,
        "end_character": 36639
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also expect new entrants to offer competitive services and carriers may also seek to build their own solutions, including using advanced tools such as AI, and particularly in markets where development costs are lower.",
        "start_character": 36640,
        "end_character": 36860
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide carriers with full-service policy administration, which minimizes their internal resource requirements and simplifies the path to distribution at scale.",
        "start_character": 21887,
        "end_character": 22055
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our ability to rapidly develop and launch new products sets us apart.",
        "start_character": 16259,
        "end_character": 16344
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete for consumers on the basis of reputation, customer service, program and product offerings, and our ability to innovate and tailor products and services to meet the specific needs of a customer.",
        "start_character": 37088,
        "end_character": 37292
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to remain active in product development, including launching Indexed Universal Life Insurance in September 2023, enhancing the consumer experience for certain of our existing products in 2024, and launching Accumulation Indexed Universal Life with North American Sammons and Cancer Insurance with Aflac in the fourth quarter of 2025.",
        "start_character": 15913,
        "end_character": 16258
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we believe we are well positioned to execute our business model and transform the life insurance industry, we actively compete with a number of companies, including agencies, brokerages, and traditional carrier distribution channels, as well as companies with online and platform offerings similar to ours.",
        "start_character": 35405,
        "end_character": 35717
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By having a sophisticated data infrastructure that provides a deep understanding of consumer intent, willingness to pay, and underwriting eligibility, we are able to allocate marketing spend more strategically.",
        "start_character": 27296,
        "end_character": 27506
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Carriers: We help life insurance carriers expand their consumer and agent reach in a manner designed to optimize risk selection and profitability, as carriers assume the insurance risk of the underlying policies.",
        "start_character": 4044,
        "end_character": 4256
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108887",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108887-f205bd2198cd2c1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108887",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-17",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, while activated policies through fintech companies have not historically been material to our third-party channel revenue and results of operations, we intend to continue developing our relationships with fintech companies to further expand our reach and reinforce our distribution.",
        "start_character": 28234,
        "end_character": 28529
      }
    ]
  },
